           fi
 
+      # -----------------------------------------------------------------
+      # PLAN-166 W1 item 2 (F3, ADR-155-AMEND-1 §5, Forma A (ii)) — the
+      # framework version marker `.claude/.framework-version` is a TRACKED
+      # one-line file, byte-identical to VERSION (the version bump writes
