   306	  # A `link_match` row means the live symlink IS the recorded delivery. The
   307	  # base --link install already created exactly that, so pointing it somewhere
   308	  # else here would silently convert every link_match row into a
   309	  # link_retargeted one — the fixture would then agree with the expectation for
