   658	
   659	TAG $TARGET_TAG IS SIGNED LOCALLY AND NOT PUSHED.
   660	
   661	Pushing starts release.yml (the gate) and npm-publish.yml (which is what
   662	publishes to npm, via OIDC). That is the irreversible, outward-facing step —
   663	it stays yours:
   664	
