    56	4. **Axis (b):** re-check by hand from a clean machine:
    57	
    58	   ```bash
    59	   curl -fsS https://registry.npmjs.org/ceo-orchestration \
    60	     | python3 -c 'import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin)["dist-tags"]["latest"])'
    61	   curl -fsS "https://registry.npmjs.org/-/npm/v1/attestations/ceo-orchestration@<latest>" \
